  "behaviour": {
    "summary": {
      "en": "A non-synchronous buck converter. Vout is 1.23 V times one plus the trimmer over 330 ohm, it can only step down, and at full duty it follows Vin minus a dropout of about 0.92 V at 1 A. Efficiency is about 80 percent at 5 V out."
    },
